{"id":"lyon","name":"里昂","en":"Lyon","country":"France","lat":45.7675,"lng":4.835,"dek":"罗讷河与索恩河之间，丝绸与电影之城","history":"里昂的前身是公元前43年建立的罗马殖民地卢格杜努姆。它由凯撒的代表卢基乌斯·穆纳提乌斯·普兰库斯创建，因处在罗讷河与索恩河交汇处，很快成为高卢首府，极盛时人口超过二十万。两河之间的半岛至今仍是城市的心脏。\n\n15世纪后期，随着意大利商人的到来，里昂成为法国的银行中心，文艺复兴时期的建筑风格也由此渗入城市肌理。丝绸贸易的兴起，特别是与中国的往来，使里昂在19世纪成为重要工业城市，红十字山一带密集的作坊和串廊就是那段时期的产物。\n\n法国大革命期间，里昂一度遭革命军大肆破坏，逾两千人被处死，拿破仑上台后才开始系统重建。二战中城市被纳粹德国占领，1944年由法国抵抗运动光复。1998年，老城与红十字山区的串廊街区被列入联合国教科文组织世界遗产名录。","culture":"里昂自称“美食之都”，传统餐馆叫bouchon。这类馆子出现于19世纪末，在1930年代经济危机时期兴盛起来：富家解雇的厨娘们自己开店，为工人阶层做饭，人称les mères。其中最出名的欧仁妮·布拉齐耶是首批获得米其林三星的厨师之一，她带过的年轻学徒叫保罗·博屈斯。\n\n这座城市也是电影诞生地。1895年，卢米埃尔兄弟在里昂拍摄了世界上第一部电影《工厂大门》。每年12月8日的灯光节，居民在窗台放蜡烛，城市把灯光投在圣母院和老建筑立面上——这个习惯源于感恩圣母玛利亚从中世纪的瘟疫中拯救了城市。","pull":"丝绸之路的尽头，电影与母亲厨娘同在","sights":[{"name":"富维耶圣母圣殿","orig":"Basilique Notre-Dame de Fourvière","intro":"19世纪建于富维耶山顶，融合角楼、枪眼、大理石和镶嵌细工，是里昂最醒目的象征。站在教堂前的平台上，可以俯瞰罗讷河与索恩河交汇处的全城景色。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/France-003038_-_Basilica_of_Notre-Dame_de_Fourvi%C3%A8re_%2815939822990%29.jpg/960px-France-003038_-_Basilica_of_Notre-Dame_de_Fourvi%C3%A8re_%2815939822990%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":649},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%8C%E7%BB%B4%E8%80%B6%E5%9C%A3%E6%AF%8D%E5%9C%A3%E6%AE%BF"},{"name":"里昂主教座堂","orig":"Cathédrale Saint-Jean-Baptiste","intro":"建于1180年至1480年，以哥特式为主，兼有罗曼式元素。堂内有一台14世纪的天文钟，每天正午至下午四点整点报时，是教堂最值得看的细节。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Three_sights_Lyon.JPG/960px-Three_sights_Lyon.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8C%E6%98%82%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99%E5%BA%A7%E5%A0%82"},{"name":"里昂老城","orig":"Vieux Lyon","intro":"索恩河西岸的中世纪与文艺复兴街区，建筑多建于15至17世纪，是欧洲最大的文艺复兴区域之一。圣若望区与红十字山区的320个串廊在1998年被列为世界遗产。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4b/Vieuxlyon_saintjean_toits.jpg/960px-Vieuxlyon_saintjean_toits.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8C%E6%98%82%E8%80%81%E5%9F%8E"},{"name":"金头公园","orig":"Parc de la Tête d'Or","intro":"位于罗讷河东岸，是欧洲最大的城市公园之一。园内有湖泊、植物园和动物园，是里昂人散步和骑行的日常去处。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Enfants_du_Rh%C3%B4ne_gate_-_Parc_de_la_T%C3%AAte_d%27Or_-_DSC05284.jpg/960px-Enfants_du_Rh%C3%B4ne_gate_-_Parc_de_la_T%C3%AAte_d%27Or_-_DSC05284.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%A4%B4%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD"},{"name":"里昂高卢罗马博物馆","orig":"Musée gallo-romain de Fourvière","intro":"建在富维耶山古罗马剧场旁，展馆大部分埋在地下，收藏雕像、硬币、碑文等，勾勒出卢格杜努姆时期的城市面貌。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Musee_galloromain_Lyon5_fr_cote.JPG/960px-Musee_galloromain_Lyon5_fr_cote.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8C%E6%98%82%E9%AB%98%E7%9B%A7%E7%BE%85%E9%A6%AC%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A4%A8"}],"foods":[{"name":"里昂沙拉","orig":"Salade lyonnaise","intro":"绿色生菜配培根丁、面包丁和一只溏心蛋。蛋黄与油醋汁混在一起，是里昂小馆子里最常见的头盘。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Salade_lyonnaise.JPG/960px-Salade_lyonnaise.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"梭鱼丸","orig":"Quenelle de brochet","intro":"面粉和鸡蛋打成的鱼糕状丸子，多以梭鱼肉制成，浇上小龙虾风味的南图阿酱。口感蓬松，是里昂最具代表性的一道热菜。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Quenelle_de_brochet_sauce_Nantua.jpg/960px-Quenelle_de_brochet_sauce_Nantua.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":643},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quenelle"},{"name":"丝绸织工脑","orig":"Cervelle de canut","intro":"新鲜白奶酪混合蒜和香草，因丝滑的质地而得名。名字里带“脑”，其实与动物脑无关，通常作为前菜配面包吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Cervelle_des_Canuts_servis_dans_le_Vieux_Lyon.jpg/960px-Cervelle_des_Canuts_servis_dans_le_Vieux_Lyon.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":645},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cervelle_de_canut"},{"name":"热香肠","orig":"Saucisson chaud","intro":"煮得滚烫的粗香肠，有时用博若莱红酒煮，有时裹在布里欧修面包里。在传统bouchon里，它常与土豆和芥末一起出现。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Saucisson_chaud_%C3%A0_la_pistache_%28mars_2021%29.jpg/960px-Saucisson_chaud_%C3%A0_la_pistache_%28mars_2021%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":644},"src":null}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/Grandes_Serres_%28Parc_de_la_T%C3%AAte_d%27Or%29-mai2011.jpg/1280px-Grandes_Serres_%28Parc_de_la_T%C3%AAte_d%27Or%29-mai2011.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":853},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/BassinNautique_Confluence_Lyon.jpg/1280px-BassinNautique_Confluence_Lyon.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[4.7718132,45.7510347],[4.7755992,45.7481157],[4.7787914,45.7475574],[4.7835875,45.7442456],[4.8024316,45.7517608],[4.8104425,45.7490542],[4.809533,45.7481066],[4.8111088,45.7475961],[4.8120797,45.7484833],[4.8134031,45.7480039],[4.8146261,45.7496506],[4.818333,45.7490757],[4.8135773,45.7433916],[4.8131414,45.7379978],[4.8145004,45.7322733],[4.8170354,45.7300933],[4.820253,45.7204878],[4.8233885,45.7146968],[4.8264132,45.7123403],[4.8376822,45.7073666],[4.8404878,45.7079597],[4.8381021,45.7136313],[4.8374498,45.718613],[4.8544946,45.7189114],[4.8536966,45.7297389],[4.8599312,45.7307286],[4.8623579,45.7269147],[4.880842,45.7217346],[4.8860552,45.7214906],[4.8875539,45.7